quiz.prompt:
An RTC is fitted. What appears on the Serial monitor when this code runs?

```
rtc.adjust(DateTime(2026, 12, 31, 23, 59, 58));
delay(3000);
DateTime t = rtc.now();
Serial.print(t.year());  Serial.print('-');
Serial.print(t.month()); Serial.print('-');
Serial.println(t.day());
```

Every time this program restarts, the time goes back to the moment the program was compiled. Which line is wrong?

```
void setup() {
  Serial.begin(9600);
  rtc.begin();
  rtc.adjust(DateTime(F(__DATE__), F(__TIME__)));
}
```
